# 🥗 AI Food Waste Predictor

An AI-powered application that predicts food waste using machine learning. The system analyzes factors such as food type, quantity, storage conditions, expiration date, and historical consumption patterns to estimate the likelihood of food being wasted. The goal is to help households, restaurants, and food businesses reduce waste and improve sustainability.

---

## 📌 Features

- 📊 Predicts food waste using Machine Learning
- 🧠 AI model trained on food inventory data
- 📅 Expiration date tracking
- 🌡️ Storage condition analysis
- 📈 Data visualization dashboard
- 💡 Waste reduction recommendations
- 🍽️ Recipe suggestions for soon-to-expire food

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Scikit-learn
- Flask / Streamlit
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn

