## ⚙️ Installation

### Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/AI-Food-Waste-Predictor.git
```

### Navigate to the project

```bash
cd AI-Food-Waste-Predictor
```

### Install dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### Run the application

```bash
python app.py
```

---

## 📊 Dataset

The dataset contains information such as:

- Food Type
- Quantity
- Purchase Date
- Expiration Date
- Storage Temperature
- Humidity
- Consumption History
- Waste Status

---

## 🤖 Machine Learning Model

The project can use:

- Random Forest
- Decision Tree
- XGBoost
- Logistic Regression

The trained model predicts whether a food item is likely to be wasted.

---

## 📈 Example Workflow

1. Load dataset
2. Preprocess data
3. Train ML model
4. Evaluate accuracy
5. Save trained model
6. Predict food waste
7. Display recommendations

